LockedOf_Vesting_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the lock helper receives an unaccepted offer
│   └── it should return zero for the offer
├── when whole months reach the schedule total
│   └── it should return zero rather than underflow
├── when the account has no grant on the class
│   └── it should return 0
├── when the grant is an offer that was not accepted
│   └── it should return 0
├── when the time is before the cliff
│   └── it should return the whole amount
├── when the time is at or after the cliff and before the end
│   ├── it should return the amount minus the vested part by whole calendar months rounded down
│   ├── given the time is exactly on a month step
│   │   └── it should include that month in the vested part
│   ├── given the time is the day before a month step
│   │   └── it should not include that month yet
│   └── given the grant started on the 31st
│       └── it should step on the last day of a 30 day month
├── when the time is at or after the end
│   └── it should return 0
├── when the grant was revoked and the time is at or after the effective date
│   ├── given the revocation was not settled
│   │   └── it should return what was locked at the effective date
│   └── given the revocation was settled
│       └── it should return 0
├── given the shareholder received more shares of the class
│   └── it should return the same locked amount
└── it should never increase as time moves forward
